An invisible line keeps a description entry open

```
:: t
:  d
*[A]: x
:  > a
   > b
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>d</dd>
  <dd>
    <blockquote><p>a
b</p></blockquote>
  </dd>
</dl>
```

```
- :: term
  : payload
%% c
   : d2
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <dl>
      <dt>term</dt>
      <dd>payload</dd>
      <dd>d2</dd>
    </dl>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
:: term
: payload
[r]: /u
 : d2
.
<dl>
  <dt>term</dt>
  <dd>payload</dd>
  <dd>d2</dd>
</dl>
```

```
:: t
: d
%%%
c
%%%
 : d2
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>d</dd>
  <dd>d2</dd>
</dl>
```

```
- :: t
  :: t2
  %%%
  c
  %%%
  :  > a
     > b
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <dl>
      <dt>t</dt>
      <dt>t2</dt>
      <dd>
        <blockquote><p>a
b</p></blockquote>
      </dd>
    </dl>
  </li>
</ul>
```
